{"title":"Gossamer Knight","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 46 Fae that attacks with shock (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 23 times (1.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/fae-bowstring\">Fae Bowstring</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>1,420</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>1,410</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>1,281</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>1,023</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>1,420</td><td>in the wilds around 1504, 1454</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight?lv=46\" title=\"Pick level 46\"><td><b>46</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>1,410</td><td>in the wilds around 1502, 1383</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight?lv=47\" title=\"Pick level 47\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>1,281</td><td>in the wilds around 2236, 1490</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>1,023</td><td>in the wilds around 2238, 1486</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 122 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 182 recorded drops, 7,907 total, 15–168 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×15–168</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"fairy-dust\" title=\"Fairy Dust - in 82 of 122 looted corpses, 75 recorded drops, 211 total, 1–5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/31b71b633f13ad01ed72.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fairy Dust</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gossamer-wing\" title=\"Gossamer Wing - in 76 of 122 looted corpses, 64 recorded drops, 94 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb